        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:IAO_0000224</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en" datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">Core is an instance of a grouping of terms from an ontology or ontologies. It is used by the ontology to identify main classes.</Literal>
