        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:IAO_0000229</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en" datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">This is to be used when a term has been split in two or more new terms. An editor note should indicate the reason for the split and indicate the URIs of the new terms created.</Literal>
