        <Literal xml:lang="en" datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">A manifestation of a disease that exists prior to the time at which it would be detected in a clinical history taking or physical examination, if the patient were to present to a clinician. A realization of a disease that exists prior to its becoming detectable in a clinical history taking or physical examination.</Literal>
