        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OGMS_0000102</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="&rdf;PlainLiteral">At the scale of organism (as opposed to the cellular scale or the population scale), an injury is typically the result of a catastrophic event. Consider the implications of making &apos;injury&apos; a subtype of &apos;disorder&apos;.

Note: Adopted subtype of disorder, and injury can occur at the scale of organism down to cellular level.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
